== iPhone 17 Pro portrait (402x874), measured ==
current (map 46%, parent-relative frame): padding 118 pt; content box ends at 722; Back/Continue y 593-649; keyboard top 539 -> BEHIND keyboard
  observed in 16d: Back/Continue 592-648 (shift 119 pt) -> matches parent-relative, not the 301 pt window overlap
C01 fix as written (map 0, status hidden, no offset): padding 118 pt; content box ends at 722; Back/Continue y 593-649; keyboard top 539 -> BEHIND keyboard
C01 fix + keyboardVerticalOffset = body window y: padding 301 pt; content box ends at 539; Back/Continue y 410-466; keyboard top 539 -> ABOVE keyboard
offset only, map still 46%: padding 301 pt leaves a 0 pt content box; the fixed rows (~128 pt) overflow and nothing is usable

